# Guards against a real recurrence (2026-08-03): a full nested clone of
# this repo (its own .git, 2.3GB, checked out at a stale commit) ended up
# at this exact path, apparently via Unity Hub's project list pointing
# "Add project from disk" at the wrong folder. Untracked either way, but
# explicit here so it can never silently get staged, and so `git status`
# stays quiet if it recurs rather than needing to be rediscovered cold.
unity/ProfitableUnity/profitable/

